/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Quantum\040Entanglement\072\040Where\040Dark\040Energy\040and\040Negative\040Gravity\040plus\040Accelerated\040Expansion\040of\040the\040Universe\040Comes\040from)
/Author (Mohamed\040S\056\040El\040Naschie)
/Subject (Dark\015\012energy\040is\040shown\040to\040be\040the\040absolute\040value\040of\040the\040negative\040kinetic\040energy\040of\040the\015\012halo\055like\040quantum\040wave\040modeled\040mathematically\040by\040the\040empty\040set\040in\040a\040five\015\012dimensional\040Kaluza\055Klein\040\050K\055K\051\040spacetime\056\040Ordinary\040or\040position\040energy\040of\040the\015\012particle\040on\040the\040other\040hand\040is\040the\040dual\040of\040dark\040energy\040and\040is\040contained\040in\040the\015\012dynamic\040of\040the\040quantum\040particle\040modeled\015\012by\040the\040zero\040set\040in\040the\040same\040five\040dimensional\040K\055K\040spacetime\056\040The\040sum\040of\040both\015\012dark\040energy\040of\040the\040wave\040and\040the\040ordinary\015\012energy\040of\040the\040particle\040is\040exactly\040equal\040to\040the\040energy\040given\040by\040the\040well\040known\015\012formula\040of\040Einstein\040E\075mc2\040which\040is\040set\040in\040a\040four\015\012dimensional\040spacetime\056\040Various\040interpretations\040of\040the\040results\040are\040presented\040and\015\012discussed\040based\040on\040the\040three\040fundamental\040energy\040density\040equations\040developed\056\040In\015\012particular\040where\040E\040is\040the\040energy\054\040m\040is\040the\015\012mass\040and\040c\040is\040the\040speed\040of\040light\054\040is\040Hardy\220s\040quantum\040entanglement\040and\040gives\040results\040in\015\012complete\040agreement\040with\040the\040cosmological\040measurements\040of\040WMAP\040and\040Supernova\056\040On\015\012the\040other\040hand\040gives\040an\040intuitive\040explanation\040of\015\012negative\040gravity\040and\040the\040observed\040increased\040rate\040of\040cosmic\040expansion\056\040Adding\040E\040\050ordinary\051\040to\040E\040\050dark\051\040one\040finds\040which\040as\040we\040mentioned\015\012above\040is\040Einstein\220s\040famous\040relativity\040formula\056\040We\040conclude\040that\040similar\040to\040the\015\012fact\040that\040the\040quantum\040wave\040interpreted\040generally\040as\040probability\040wave\040which\040is\015\012devoid\040of\040ordinary\040energy\040decides\040upon\040the\040location\040of\040a\040quantum\040particle\054\040it\015\012also\040exerts\040a\040negative\040gravity\040effect\040on\040the\040cosmic\040scale\040of\040our\040clopen\054\040i\056e\056\040closed\040and\040open\040universe\056\040Analysis\040and\040conclusions\040are\040framed\040in\040a\040reader\040friendly\015\012manner\040in\040Figures\0401\05514\040with\040detailed\015\012commentary\056)
